\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\lang9 The estate\rquote s core problem is **competing truths**, not missing dashboards. Cyber state, operational state, safety state, and resilience state disagree, and the current \ldblquote command center\rdblquote  idea would automate that disagreement unless forensics come first.\par
\par
